      "content": "idk. it feels less like a \"chance\" and more like there's just nothing there. like the person who actually lived my life is just... dead. it's not that i'm lost, it's that the person who was supposed to be doing the finding is gone. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the eyes looking back. it's just an empty shell moving through the motions. it feels so heavy and pointless.",
